            <p>There were also other, business-oriented aspects of this role - things like 2x2s, et. al. - where I contributed strategic guidance for shaping the business based on customer feedback <parenthetical>(nothing like hearing the sweet, sweet sound of an MBA's voice telling you that what the customer wants only matters if 10x revenue is returned!)</parenthetical>.</p>
